    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GWD ESTATES are delighted to present this bright and spacious three-bedroom mid-terrace family home to the Dublin 11 property market, ideally positioned within the popular Lanesborough development in Finglas.\r\n\r\nNo. 29 Lanesborough Gardens is perfectly situated within this well-established residential estate and is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers including first-time buyers and investors due to its high rental yield. The location has every conceivable amenity on its doorstep. Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, DCU, Tesco clearwater and a large selection of both primary & schools, shops, parks and sporting facilities are all close by. The area is also well serviced by public transport, with numerous buses to the city centre, while the M50 motorway is only minutes away providing easy access to Dublin Airport and the M1 and port tunnel.\r\nAccommodation: Entrance hallway with wooden floors. Bright modern spacious kitchen cum dining room with floor and wall units with ceramic floor and wall tiles. Large sitting room with wooden floors and feature fireplace and French doors to rear garden. Downstairs toilet. Upstairs there are 3 generous sized bedrooms with built in wardrobes and a family bathroom as well as a large ensuite.\r\nThe property has a fenced south facing rear garden with shed. The front garden has a drive in. There are Double glazed Pvc windows and gas fired central heating.\r\nViewing is strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway: 16'8'' x 5'11'' Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nSitting room: 18'10'' x 15'9'' Wooden floors with feature fireplace and French doors.\r\n\r\nKitchen cum dining room: 16'5'' x 9'6'' Fitted floor and wall presses with ceramic floor and wall tiles.\r\n\r\nDownstairs toilet: toilet and sink.\r\n\r\nLanding: carpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 13'4'' x 10'5'' Wooden floors with built in wardrobes and ensuite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 11'11'' x 9'1'' Wooden floors with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 8'6'' x 6'10'' Wooden Floors.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 9'8'' x 5'1'' bath, toilet and sink with ceramic wall tiles."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
